Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.13,0:00:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好  嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.54,0:00:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们觉得怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指什么   指什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}About what? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.34,0:00:16.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吗  好吧  我给你们一个提示  一个提示\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding? Okay, I'll give you a hint. I'll give you a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛  不  你的眼睛  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eyes. No, no. Your eyes! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德的眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.73,0:00:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我戴上了眼镜啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都戴着眼镜啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You always had glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是戴着一副\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Didn't you used to have a pair?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,圆形酒红色的眼镜   看起来有一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They were really round and burgundy, and they made you look kind of, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,娘娘腔   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Feminine. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  我觉得你很适合戴眼镜  看起来很性感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sweetie, I think the glasses look great. They make you look sexy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.51,0:00:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会也以为  我以前有戴眼镜吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You didn't think I used to wear glasses, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第3集  菲比的食谱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E03  The One With Phoebe's Cookies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.65,0:01:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.67,0:01:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.13,0:01:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要什么订婚礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what do you guys want for an engagement present?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:01:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系   菲比  我们不办派对了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's okay, Pheebs, we're not having a party or anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.41,0:02:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你们不必送我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so you don't have to get us-Ah, buh-buh-buh! Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.37,0:02:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人想送我们礼物   我们不该剥夺他们的快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If someone wants to give us a present, we don't want to deprive them of that joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.46,0:02:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道该送他们什么呢  你该送一台便携式CD唱机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, y'know what you should get 'em? One of those little uh, portable CD players.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.17,0:02:10.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经有一台了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I already have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.67,0:02:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但有人借走了   还把它忘在妇产科诊所了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless someone borrowed it and left it at the gynecologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.09,0:02:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  至于"那个人"  她指的是乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and by "someone"  she means Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.97,0:02:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我想要什么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I know what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我们想要什么  甜心  不  你不会要这个礼物的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What we want, honey. No, you don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要你奶奶的饼干食谱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to have your grandmother's cookie recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说那个巧克力碎片饼干的食谱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You mean the chocolate chip cookie recipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊   我奶奶临死前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh, yeah. You mean the one that my grandmother...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要我发誓那个饼干食谱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...made me swear on her deathbed...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.61,0:02:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不能泄露给外人的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that I would never let out of our family?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快死的人都会胡言乱语的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dying people say the craziest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多年来我一直都想得到它   我想帮我的孩子们做饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've wanted it for years. I was gonna make cookies for my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很难过   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Break my heart. Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要当  能做出全世界最好吃饼干的妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be the mom who makes the world's best chocolate chip cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.46,0:02:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的孩子会是胖子   对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our kids are gonna be fat, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:02.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahoy! Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,驾帆船出海还好玩吧  太棒了  我开始喜欢驾驶帆船了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How's the boat? Great! I'm finally getting into this sailing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.35,0:03:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次你终于出海了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, so you finally took it out of the marina?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三个彪形大汉使出吃奶的力气   才把它漂在海上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It took three guys to get the thing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:15.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不想开它出海   你在船上都做些什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you don't sail your boat,  what do you do on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.98,0:03:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,光是坐在上面就很舒服了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's great! It's a great place to just kind of sit...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.03,0:03:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么都不做   喝喝啤酒   吃吃洋芋片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...hang around, drink a few beers, eat some chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你终于找到了  能那样潇洒的地方了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, It's good that you finally have a place to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  如果你要的话   我可以教你驾驶帆船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know Joey, I could teach you to sail if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.58,0:03:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会驾驶帆船  对啊   我这辈子都在驾船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You could? Yeah, I've been sailing my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我十五岁时  我爸就送了我一艘帆船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I was 15, my dad bought me my own boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.67,0:03:39.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一艘帆船   怎么了  他想要安慰我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your own boat? What?! What?! He was trying to cheer me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.01,0:03:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的小马生病了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My pony was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.64,0:03:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.23,0:03:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我在想什么吗   什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I was thinking? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.86,0:03:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  我只是想这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing, I just like to go like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:04:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  今晚你做什么  你有课吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, what are you doing tonight? Why, do you have a lecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.49,0:04:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊  怎么了  那么我没事了  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, why? Then, free as a bird. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.95,0:04:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸想约你去打回力球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, my dad wants to know if you want to play racquetball with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  爸一定很喜欢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, that's great! Dad must really like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.79,0:04:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从来不会约人去打回力球   他没有约你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He doesn't ask just anyone to play. Yeah and he didn't really ask for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要约"小钱"   我猜他应该是指你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He asked for "Chauncey." I assumed he meant you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你纠正他了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you correct him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.80,0:04:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我觉得那样子比较好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I thought it would be more fun this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太酷了  或许你们每周都该这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is so cool, maybe this is something you can do this every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你也可以坐在走廊上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or you could sit on the front porch...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确定下垃圾桶不会被偷走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and make sure no one steals the trash cans.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.81,0:04:31.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他每周都会这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He does that every week too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.27,0:04:36.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得让他赢   他最讨厌输了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just so you know, you have to let him win. He hates to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.73,0:04:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题   要不我用左手打球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no problem. Maybe I'll play with my left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是左撇子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not a lefty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.65,0:04:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人认识我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does anybody know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.45,0:04:51.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's wrong, Phoebe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到以前的公寓去拿饼干食谱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just went to my old apartment to get you the cookie recipe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.25,0:04:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那场该死的大火把它烧光了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and that stupid fire burned it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你为什么没有复印一份  把它放在防火的盒子里呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! Why didn't you make a copy and keep it in a fireproof box...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且要它远离起火点   至少一百码的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and keep it at least 100 yards away from the original?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我只是个凡人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I'm normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.14,0:05:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我奶奶留给我的传奇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was the one legacy my grandmother left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你要它当你的订婚礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I know you wanted it as an engagement present.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得送你们订婚礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to get you an engagement present?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:25.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry about it. Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.53,0:05:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人送我订婚礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No one got me an engagement present.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我没有食谱了  但这个给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here. I don't have the recipe, but here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:34.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们健康快乐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish you health and happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一块放了很久的饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}An old cookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:41.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不列出礼物清单   就会发生这种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, this is what happens when you don't register for gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了一些饼干  把它们冷冻起来   这是最后一块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See no-no, I made a batch and I froze it. And this is the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能收下它  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can't accept this. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为它很恶心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because it's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.81,0:05:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  等一下  我想我可以利用这块饼干搞出整个食谱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, wait. I think I can figure out the recipe from this cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.27,0:05:58.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在工作时常常这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do stuff like this at work all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:00.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  真的  我想我应该可以做到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah, I think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   罗斯  我们欠你一份礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Ross, we owe you a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:09.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是两份   我订过两次婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two! I've been engaged twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快来看看这个小丑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at this clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他以为整条河都是他的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because he's got a bigger boat he thinks he can take up the whole river.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.96,0:06:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别挡路啊   大混蛋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Get out of the way, jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会把自己的船   命名为"海岸防卫队"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who names their boat Coast Guard, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们就是海岸防卫队   那他们在这里做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is the Coast Guard. What are they doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海岸在那边的嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The coast is all the way over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  别管那些船了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, just ignore the boats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的课还没上完   好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not finished with our lesson. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要帮你复习一下基本要点  准备好了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go over the basic points just one more time, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.65,0:06:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别麻烦了  瑞秋  我已经懂了  开始驾驶吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Rach. Not again. I got it, okay? Let's start sailing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想把船开到   那边有一船小妞旁边去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to go over there where that boatload of girls is. Yeah, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   你想要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. is that what you wanna to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.41,0:06:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过去跟那些小妞鬼混\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna go over and give a little shout out to the old, hot chickas?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  来吧   水手乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's do that, Sailor Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快问快答   这个叫什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Quick question, though: What's this called?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,船绳   错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, boat rope? Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.63,0:07:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么把主帆升上去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you get the mainsail up? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.93,0:07:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摸一下就行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rub it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  如果我说我们要转向了  你该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. What do you do if I say we're coming about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会说  "随你转"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd say, "Come again?" Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:27.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不   我知道   这一题我会做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, wait I-I-I know this one, I know this one. Uh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,时间到   现在你死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Time's up. Now you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:31.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也聋了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And deaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你继续开玩笑吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you just go on and make your little jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不知道自己在海上做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you don't know what you're doing out at sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就会在海上丧命   听懂了吗   水手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you will die at sea. Am I getting through to you, sailor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懂了  别只是说你懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Don't just say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:45.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是游戏  乔伊  你真可能会受伤的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't a game. Joey you can really get hurt out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要注意听我说话呢   还是想找死呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, So do you want to pay attention, or do you want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:54.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想从船上给钱德打电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to make a ship-to-shore call to Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.73,0:08:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吃到了肉豆壳  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I definitely taste nutmeg. You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.69,0:08:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没吃到吗   那就是专业人员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't? Heh. Well, that's the difference...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.69,0:08:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟外行人的不同点了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...between a professional and a layman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:14.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  专业人员很傲慢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That and arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   出海好玩吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. How was sailing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想谈这件事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们至少可以留一块饼干给我   不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, You could've saved me a whole cookie. No-wait-no-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女人太无情了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Women are mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.35,0:08:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我奶奶的传奇   就只剩下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now the only thing left of my grandmother's legacy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.23,0:08:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一块碎屑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...this crumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.81,0:08:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你们白头偕老   婚姻美满\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish you a long and happy marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.78,0:08:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我玩得很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是小钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, Chauncey on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:09:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我来说吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will tell the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.41,0:09:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们相处甚欢   我放手让他赢球   他喜欢我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was going great. I let him win, we were bonding...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至说我可以叫他爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...he even said I could call him Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他要你不能叫他什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what did he ask you not to call him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爹地\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Daddy."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着   事情是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right look, here's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们打完球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we had just finished playing racquetball...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想去做三温暖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and we were gonna take a steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.39,0:09:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我走进蒸气室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I walk into the steam room...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面雾气弥漫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it's really steamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是我拿下眼镜   悲剧发生了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I take off my glasses, and that's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这边来   坐吧   孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Over here. Have a seat, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.38,0:09:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  钱德  我不敢相信  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, Chandler! I can't believe it. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.55,0:09:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在我爸大腿上跳艳舞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gave my father a lap dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.43,0:10:00.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们为什么要把那里弄得雾气弥漫的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do they put so much steam in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不那么做的话   那里只能叫做 "房间"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because otherwise they'd have to call it the "room" room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么会发生那种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why, okay? Why? Why did that have to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样啊   没有什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, it's not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.49,0:10:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是没有什么大不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not that big a deal? There--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那会有一种异样的触感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There was touching of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:22.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你想跟我爸搞好关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I know you wanted to bond with my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:26.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你一定要从他那个地方开始吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but did you really have to bond to that part?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信爸不会在乎的  或许他只是会觉得很好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, I'm sure that Dad doesn't care. He probably thought this was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会把这个故事挂在嘴边好几年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He'll be telling this story for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是不希望他这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want him to tell this story for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   但他会那么做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, but he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他还是会告诉大家  摩妮卡试图逃出减肥营的故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He still tells the story about how Monica tried to escape from fat camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.35,0:10:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有逃跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:50.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你怎么会被卡在铁丝网上的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then how'd you get caught in the barbed wire?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要救一只松鼠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was trying to help out a squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.02,0:10:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想吃掉他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were trying to eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果是你爸打电话来   告诉你这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If that is your father calling to tell this story...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.20,0:11:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们的婚礼就要取消了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then the marriage is off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.45,0:11:06.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样啊   喂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.25,0:11:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起   你打错电话了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, you have the wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我待会回你电话  爸   我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'll call you later, Dad. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我要去见你爸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'm off to see your dad. Oh, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会是穿的太多了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa-whoa, aren't you a little over dressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好确定  这次他会付你小费\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and you better make sure he tips you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.81,0:11:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说服他  别再提那件事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I figured I would try to convince him not to tell the story anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想最好的办法   就是跟他面对面谈一谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I figured the best way to do that was face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的 "面对面"  指的不是他的大腿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And by "face," I don't mean his lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:41.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说的"面对面"  指的不是我的屁股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And by "face," I don't mean my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要送摩妮卡跟钱德订婚礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you getting Monica and Chandler an engagement present?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道   他们没有送我们礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. You know, they didn't get us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么时候再出航   伙伴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when are we getting back out on the water, matey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:03.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道水手是怎么说的   但我死都不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, uh, I don't know the boat way to say this, but, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么   因为你在船上很凶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not? Because you're mean on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   我只是想教会你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I was just trying to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.69,0:12:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的确长了教训   那就是瑞秋很凶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, lesson learned. Rachel is mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.06,0:12:18.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  对  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yep, yep, Yep, Yep, Yep, Yep-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.28,0:12:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还记得她驾驶她爸的船带我出海\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I remember when she took me out on her dad's boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全不让我插手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She wouldn't let me help out at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我要你帮我  但你连动都动不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me, I wanted you to help. But you couldn't move your arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.41,0:12:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你穿了三件救生衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because you were wearing three life jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得敬畏大海\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have to respect the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  如果你觉得我很凶   对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Joey, I'm sorry if you thought that was mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我要告诉你   我一点都不凶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I tell you something, that was not mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸才凶   以前在船上  他总会对我大吼大叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My father is mean. He used to yell at me all the time on the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才真的可怕   我是个很棒的老师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was horrible. I was being a really good teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.64,0:12:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好老师会说   "把啤酒放下  猪头"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does a good teacher say, "Put down the beer, pinhead!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好学生会在上第一堂课时  就喝掉七罐啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does a good student drink 7 beers during his first lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是六罐半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Six and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.06,0:13:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把最后一罐从我手里敲掉   还记得吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You knocked that last one out of my hand. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望你被船桨打中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I didn't want you to get hit by the boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的确打中我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it hit me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能喝完最后一罐啤酒  或许不会那么痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it would have hurt a lot less if I had finished that last beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我会试着小声点  不再对你大吼大叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}y'know what? I'm sorry. I will try to tone it down and, uh, stop yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会再使唤我  我不会再使唤你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You won't boss me around? I won't boss you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会对我很好  我会对你很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you'll be nice? And, I'll be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:21.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会脱掉上衣   乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you'll be topless? And I-Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你希望我学会吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want me to learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是22号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here's batch 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.43,0:13:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许它们跟你奶奶的饼干味道很像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe these'll taste like your grandmother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我放了一些橘子皮  没有放肉豆壳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This has a little bit of orange peel, but no nutmeg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来试试尝尝吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm. Let's give it a shot. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.69,0:13:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从九年级后  我再也没做过这么多饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have not made so many cookies since 9th grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为了义卖会做那么多饼干吗  不  那是我星期五晚上要吃的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was that for, Like a bake sale? No, just a Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.66,0:13:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些饼干真的很好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm. These are pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.74,0:13:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但没有17号好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but not as good as batch 17. Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.41,0:13:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,17号是哪一块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which one was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:56.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你几乎快吐出来后  吃的那块饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The ones we had after you almost threw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:14:00.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  17号很好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, batch 17 was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.59,0:14:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢16号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did not like batch 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.80,0:14:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吃的还有剩的吗   我们可以好好研究一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are there any more from the good batch? We could work off those.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我想17号应该还剩一块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah, I think there's one from batch 17 left. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:22.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,16号  这是16号  别挡路\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Batch 16. Sixteen, people, get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊  你表现得很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Joey. Honey, you're doing really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你站到左舷边上去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just need you to step to the portside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得   左舷是哪一边吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Remember? Remember how we talked about the portside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然记得   右边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:52.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是左边   甜心  没关系   那一题太难了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's left, sweetie, but that's okay. That's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不干脆说左边就好了呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know why you just don't say left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.31,0:14:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  到左边去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, go to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,左边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem, the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐在那边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? Just sit over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到没   你又在大吼大叫了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay! Okay! You're yelling again. See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我很小声  语气充满了爱意  我没有大吼大叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, no. Very quiet. Said with love, no yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.49,0:15:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, y'know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.91,0:15:17.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我已经坐在这里了   我就要在左舷喝一罐啤酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Since I'm here, I'm gonna have me a little beer on the portside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到我刚刚做了什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See what I did there? Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  风有点大   麻烦你把船绳拉紧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay Joey, We're luffing a little bit, Will you tighten up the Cunningham?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:31.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说了一堆我听不懂的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, you just said a bunch of stuff I didn't know there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:34.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  别这样  我刚刚才教过你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, come on! We just went over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你教我的时候  有只乌嘴巴里衔着鱼飞了过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, y'know, when we did that was when that bird was overhead with the fish in his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗   好恶心  没有  我没有看到鸟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you see it? It was gross. No! All right?! I did not see the bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:46.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有看到鱼  也没看到形状像泰森的保丽龙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did not see the fish! I did not see the piece of Styrofoam shaped like Mike Tyson!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有看到   因为我忙着教你驾驶帆船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did not, because I was trying to teach you how to sail a boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显   那是不可能的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which obviously is an impossible thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.03,0:15:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  你在大吼大叫  而且你也没有脱掉上衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right that's it! You're yelling, and I don't see you taking your top off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.75,0:16:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思  你不能放弃   为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean? You can't quit. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有学会  我不准你那么做  葛林家的人不会放弃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you're not finished! I won't have it. Greens do not quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,葛林家的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Greens?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我姓崔比亚尼  崔比亚尼家的人会放弃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a Tribbiani. And Tribbianis quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚我说  "葛林家的人不会放弃" 对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did I--? I just said, "Greens don't quit," didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到底说了没有  说了  你还在对我大吼大叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did I just say, "Greens don't quit"? Yes! And you're still yelling at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.69,0:16:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我没有对你大吼大叫  我是对你身边的空气大吼大叫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No! No! I'm not yelling at you. I'm just yelling near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   乔伊  我就跟我爸一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God, Joey. Oh, I'm my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   真的太可怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:38.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很努力不要跟我妈一样  却没有提防到这一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been trying so hard not to be my mother, I did not see this coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我真的很抱歉  我只希望你能学会驾驶帆船\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry, I'm so sorry. I just wanted you to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hey
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.09,0:16:52.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的确学会了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗   没错  来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.14,0:16:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Yeah. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道主帆是什么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know what a mainsail is. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.81,0:17:04.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道船桨过来时   一定要低头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know to duck when the boom comes across.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道左舷是右边   左边才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know port is right. Left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.23,0:17:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.78,0:17:15.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们试着研究出了她的食谱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I bet it would make my grandma very happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会让我奶奶觉得开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to know that we're trying to figure out her recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:23.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说  她正抬头看着我们  对我们微笑呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I bet she's looking up at us and smiling right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:26.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抬头看我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looking UP?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她对我真的很好   但现在她一定在地狱里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, no, she was really nice to me but she's in hell for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.17,0:17:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经努力过了  我放弃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I've tried everything. I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法成为做出全世界  最好吃饼干的妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna be the morn who makes the world's best cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.76,0:17:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我会做最好吃的花椰菜配油封鸭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do make the best duck confit with broccoli raab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小孩子很喜欢吃那道菜吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kids love that, right'?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.98,0:17:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   难道你家的亲戚都没有食谱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, Pheeb, come on isn't there any relative that would have the recipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你姊姊呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about, What about your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.61,0:17:55.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我跟自己发誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. I made a promise to myself that the next time...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.65,0:17:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我死掉  不然我不会跟乌苏拉说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I would talk to Ursula is over my dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那一天将会是2032年10月15日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that's not happening until October 15, 2032.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天你会死掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the day you're gonna die? See.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天  我要去玩推圆盘游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Darn it, I've got shuffleboard that day. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你少做梦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.88,0:18:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你奶奶的朋友呢  他们没有食谱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, What about friends of your grandmother? Would they have the recipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.01,0:18:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在法国的亲戚   可能有人知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, You know, I may have relatives in France who would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我奶奶说食谱是她奶奶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My grandmother said she got the recipe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"鸟巢"传给她的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...from her grandmother, "Nestley Toulouse."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:32.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她叫什么名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What was her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鸟巢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nestley Toulouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雀巢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nestle Toll House?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.24,0:18:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国人就是没办法说好法文\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You Americans always butcher the French language.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比   这是你奶奶的食谱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, is this the recipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.75,0:18:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信  我花了两天时间研究那份食谱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I cannot believe that I spent the last two days trying to figure out that recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.73,0:19:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果它一直在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was in my cupboard the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.98,0:19:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道   就是这样的事情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know! You see, it is stuff like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害得你得在地狱里受苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...which is why you're burning in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.78,0:19:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你懂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你可以不把那件事说出去  我会觉得舒服一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd feel a lot more comfortable if you didn't tell people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.07,0:19:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很不好意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I’m a little...I'm a little embarrassed about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.91,0:19:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全了解   最可怕的事莫过于\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I understand completely. There's nothing more horrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.45,0:19:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在丈人跟丈母娘面前丢脸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...than embarrassing yourself in front of your in-laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上我开始跟茱蒂交往时   根本就没有工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As a matter of fact, when I started dating Judy, I was unemployed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.67,0:19:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她爸问我是干哪一行的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and her father asked me what I did for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说我是律师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told him I was a lawyer. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们发现事实后你怎么办  他们一直都没有发现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What'd you do when they found out? They never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你看到我在帮他们做法律咨询   只要点头就行了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So if you ever see me giving them legal advice, just nod along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以进去了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.41,0:20:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜这里得穿泳装才能进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, I guess we wear swimsuits in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.59,0:20:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊   我得承认\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Joey, I hate to admit it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的航海方式   真的有趣多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...your way of sailing is a lot more fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yep. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.31,0:20:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你何不拉一下那条绳子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, why don't you give a pull on that rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.64,0:20:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有要出海\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're not sailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.02,0:20:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉下  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just pull on it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.36,0:20:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三明治\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sandwiches!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然会是什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What else? Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.57,0:20:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢   哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么   对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing? Oops. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.83,0:20:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别那样   好料的都掉在地上了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't hold it like that. You're letting all the good stuff fall out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.17,0:20:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Oops. Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.09,0:21:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你浪费了好吃的腌燻牛肉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're wasting good pastrami!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊   我就跟我爸一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I'm my dad!
